          "description": "Writes little-endian values in contribution field order at byteOffset. Align scalars to 4 bytes, vec2 to 8 and vec4 to 16. The same bytes feed both backends. Required when the selected contribution declares uniforms. Called once per GPU simulation step. Stateful modules should advance their clock here instead of apply(), which does not run in GPU mode."
